     3686     excel-sum(bo-Ostatok-end  [6])  CHR(9)
     3687     excel-sum(bo-Ostatok-end  [9])  CHR(9)
     3688     skip.
     3689                End.
     3690      WHEN ""  Then     DO :
     3691       DISPLAY stream  OutStream sym1 sym2 sym3 sym4 sym5 sym6 sym7 sym8 sym9 sym10 sym11 sym12
     3692         p3 @ s-bar-code
     3693         p4 @ gds-zap-artic
     3694         p5 @ gds-zap-gds-name
     3695         p6 @ gds-zap-unit-base
     3696         p1 @ gds-type
     3697         ostatok-start [p2] format "->>>>>>>>>>9.<<<" @  F-ostatok-start
     3698         Prih          [p2] format "->>>>>>>>>>9.<<<" @  F-Prih
     3699         RAsh          [p2] format "->>>>>>>>>>9.<<<" @  F-RAsh
     3700         KAssa         [p2] format "->>>>>>>>>>9.<<<" @  F-KAssa
     3701         Inv           [p2] format "->>>>>>>>>>9.<<<" @  F-Inv
     3702         Overturn      [p2] format "->>>>>>>>>>9.<<<" @  F-Overturn
     3703         Ostatok-end   [p2] format "->>>>>>>>>>9.<<<" @  F-Ostatok-end
     3704         gds-zap-other      format "->>>>>>>>>>9.<<<" when (p2 = 1) @  gds-zap-other
     3705         with FRAME ZAPAS .
     3706   if Make-Excel then  put   stream ForExcel unformatted
     3707     p3 CHR(9)
     3708     p4 CHR(9)
     3709     gds-zap-gds-name CHR(9)
     3710     p6 CHR(9)
     3711     gds-zap-type     CHR(9)
     3712     excel-sum(gds-zap-other   )   CHR(9)
     3713     excel-qnty(ostatok-start[1])  CHR(9)
     3714     excel-sum(ostatok-start[2])  CHR(9)
     3715     excel-sum(ostatok-start[5])  CHR(9)
     3716     excel-sum(ostatok-start[8])  CHR(9)
