     3760     excel-sum(Ostatok-end  [6])  CHR(9)
     3761     excel-sum(Ostatok-end  [9])  CHR(9)
     3762     skip.
     3763                 End.
     3764      End case.
     3765                  DOWN stream   OutStream 1 with FRAME ZAPAS.
     3766    END PROCEDURE.
